[en.FOCUS_C12_UNPRECEDENTED_PROSPERITY]
Unprecedented Prosperity

[en.FOCUS_C12_UNPRECEDENTED_PROSPERITY_desc]
We’ve completed the industrial reform, and the image of poverty and backwardness has become a thing of the past. The ponies of the quarry farm no longer worry about food and shelter for tomorrow. Fashion trends have become increasingly mentioned in the mouths of ponies.

[zh.FOCUS_C12_UNPRECEDENTED_PROSPERITY]
未曾预料过的繁荣

[zh.FOCUS_C12_UNPRECEDENTED_PROSPERITY_desc]
我们完成了工业改革，贫困落后的形象已经成为了过去的阴影，采石农场的小马们不再为明天的食物和住所担忧，“时尚”、“名流谷潮流”成了小马口中提及到的越来越多的词汇。

